meshoptimizer
------------------------------------------
Mesh optimization library that makes meshes smaller and faster to render

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmeshoptimizer-devel-1.3-1bl1
  libmeshoptimizer1-1.3-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer/archive/refs/tags/v1.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack meshoptimizer-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./meshoptimizer-1.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/meshoptimizer-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/meshoptimizer-1.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmeshoptimizer1-1.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmeshoptimizer-devel-1.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(meshoptimizer)
  /usr/bin/gltfpack.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/meshoptimizer.README
  /usr/share/doc/meshoptimizer/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/meshoptimizer/README.md

(libmeshoptimizer1)
  /usr/bin/cygmeshoptimizer-1.dll

(libmeshoptimizer-devel)
  /usr/include/meshoptimizer.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/meshoptimizer/meshoptimizerConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/meshoptimizer/meshoptimizerConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/meshoptimizer/meshoptimizerTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/meshoptimizer/meshoptimizerTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libmeshoptimizer.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/meshoptimizer.pc

